    ///
    ///# Declared schemes
    ///
    ///- `accountServiceKey` — `http` (`bearer`).
    ///  - Account Service Key, prefixed with `pho_ask_`, sent as `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Acts on behalf of its owning account, subject to the permissions and credential restrictions of each operation. Account access tokens and OAuth grants also use the Bearer header. In organizations that require SSO, Account Service Keys are not accepted for managing the organization's SSO settings, deleting the organization, or checking whether it can be deleted.
    ///- `oauth2` — `oauth2`.
    ///  - OAuth grant issued by the Photon authorization server. The token is a bearer JWT whose consented scope is intersected with the permissions the route grants; an empty intersection is `403 insufficient_scope`.
    ///  - Flow `authorizationCode`:
    ///    - authorization: <https://auth.photon.codes/oauth2/authorize>
    ///    - token: <https://auth.photon.codes/oauth2/token>
    ///    - scope `account:create_project` — Create a project owned by the account.
    ///    - scope `account:read` — View account profile.
    ///    - scope `account:read_projects` — List projects associated with the account; does not grant access to project contents.
    ///    - scope `account:write` — Update account name and profile.
    ///    - scope `billing:read` — View invoices, usage, payment status.
    ///    - scope `events:read` — Query stored Events and discover their SQL schema within a project.
    ///    - scope `organization:create_project` — Create a project in the organization.
    ///    - scope `organization:read` — View organization name and avatar.
    ///    - scope `organization:read_projects` — List projects in the organization.
    ///    - scope `platforms:read` — View project platform configuration.
    ///    - scope `platforms:write` — Change project platform configuration.
    ///    - scope `project:delete` — Permanently delete the project.
    ///    - scope `project:read` — View non-sensitive project settings.
    ///    - scope `project:read_usage` — View project usage and costs.
    ///    - scope `project:write` — Change agent profiles, webhook settings, and other project configuration.
    ///    - scope `ten_dlc:read` — View organization 10DLC Brand and Campaign registration records.
    ///    - scope `ten_dlc:write` — Register and update organization 10DLC Brands and Campaigns, including OTP operations.
    ///- `projectApiKey` — `http` (`bearer`).
    ///  - Project API key, `pho_sk_` prefixed, sent as `Authorization: Bearer <key>`. Bound to one project, so it is accepted only under `/v1/projects/{projectId}` and refused everywhere else.
    ///- `serviceIdentityBearer` — `http` (`bearer`).
    ///  - Organization Service Identity API key or M2M access token, sent as `Authorization: Bearer <credential>`. Restricted to its organization and explicitly granted business permissions. It does not authorize human organization governance or Photon credential management. Never send an M2M client secret to a business endpoint.
